# This app no longer needs any environment variables to run the CMS: the
# admin password and all page content live in a SQLite database at
# data/cms.sqlite3 (created automatically on first run).
#
# On first visiting /admin with a fresh database, you'll be sent to
# /admin/setup to create the admin password (stored hashed in the database).
# You can change it later at /admin/settings.
